  "question": {
    "text": "The shape/structure of<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\"><msub><mi>XeF</mi><mn>5</mn></msub></mfenced><mo>-</mo></msup></math> and <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>XeO</mi><mn>3</mn></msub><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">F</mi><mn>2</mn></msub></math>, respectively are :"
